id="table2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><title>Diode currents recorded as a function of energy at X06SA of the SLS, and the corresponding calculated photon fluxes</title></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead valign="top"><tr><th style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" charoff="50" valign="bottom">&#x000a0;</th><th style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="bottom">AXUV diode</th><th style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="bottom">Sintef diode</th><th style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="bottom">Hamamatsu 10</th><th style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="bottom">Canberra 500</th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">Silicon thickness (&#x000b5;m)</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">300</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">12</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">10</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">500</td></tr><tr><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">Aluminium cover (&#x000b5;m)</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">N/A</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">20</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">N/A</td><td style="" rowspan="1" colspan="2" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">N/A</td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan="1" colspan="1" align="left" charoff="50" valign="top">mm of air</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" rowspan